{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11224110","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11224110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1122411001:0":{"text":"실버 빅, 왜 우리에게 당신이 주문한 물건이 폭약통이란 걸 말하지 않았어요? 정말 별의별 생각을 다 했다고요!","source_cn":"银喙，你怎么不告诉我们你订的东西是炸药桶？害我们胡思乱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95530B9FBF155B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1122411002:0":{"text":"이런 극비의 계획은 아는 사람이 적을수록 더 좋으니까.","source_cn":"这么机密的计划，肯定是越少人知道越好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7631F4C247357FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1122411003:0":{"text":"만약 누군가가 우리의 말과 행동에서 이상한 점을 알아챘다면 계획은 수포로 돌아갔을 거야.","source_cn":"否则，要是被人从咱们的一言一行中察觉出了异样，我可就白...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABDDBFE1725D9BBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:银喙":{"text":"실버 빅","source":"银喙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}